 cheese (no heat, 2 min)","heat":"no heat","minutes":2,"instructions":"Once layering is complete, cover the top with the remaining shredded cheese."},{"n":7,"title":"Cover and bake (medium, 30 min)","heat":"medium","minutes":30,"instructions":"Cover the dish with foil and bake in the preheated oven for 30 minutes."},{"n":8,"title":"Uncover and finish baking (medium, 5 min)","heat":"medium","minutes":5,"instructions":"Remove the foil, sprinkle with chopped green onion tops, and bake for an additional 5 minutes until the cheese is melted and bubbly."},{"n":9,"title":"Cool before serving (no heat, 10-15 min)","heat":"no heat","minutes":13,"instructions":"Let the casserole sit for 10-15 minutes to cool before serving to avoid a soupy texture."}],"plating":{"serve_style":"casserole","assembly_instructions":"","optional_toppings":[]},"macros_per_serving":{"calories":325,"protein_g":26,"carbs_g":26,"fat_g":12},"chosen_protein":"chicken","primary_protein_source":"chicken","meal_style":"casserole","why_it_fits_tonight":"A hearty, cheesy dish perfect for the crew.","cleanup_tip":"Soak pots and pans right after plating while they're still warm. Wipe down prep surfaces and return unused ingredients to storage immediately.","pro_tips":["Scaled from 8 servings to 10 — check single-use items (whole cans, eggs) individually.","Taste and adjust seasoning after scaling — salt doesn't always scale linearly."],"budget_level":"low","recipe_tags":{"cuisine":"mexican","cooking_method":"oven","base_carb":"none","key_ingredients":["verde enchilada sauce","cheese","chicken pre","canned tomatoes","refried beans"],"high_protein":false,"high_fiber":false,"quick_cleanup":false},"template_id":0,"_signature":"casserole|chicken|mexican|tortilla|oven|canned tomatoes,cheese,chicken pre,flour tortillas torn into bite sized pieces,refried beans,verde enchilada sauce","_id":"851501a0-13b2-441c-80c3-c2b058b33557"}
